From d25b78013d7761b7f36fb645f488bf79bb3ad4b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:31:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 37/55] Later evolutions: 18 same-typing evolutions and eight
 evolution items

Magnezone, Lickilicky, Rhyperior, Tangrowth, Electivire, Magmortar,
Togekiss, Yanmega, Gliscor, Mamoswine, Porygon-Z, Dusknoir, Honchkrow,
Mismagius, Ambipom, Roserade, Farigiraf and Dudunsparce as real species
(graphics and cries from pokeemerald-expansion, data from Showdown).
New "level up knowing a move" evolution method; Razor Fang, Dusk Stone,
Shiny Stone, Protector, Electirizer, Magmarizer, Dubious Disc and Reaper
Cloth as usable evolution items (Celadon Dept. Store 4F). The National
Pokedex lists added Pokemon in real-number order; full habitat pages get
an extra page. add_species.py now reads each Pokemon's data from the
expansion.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
